# React Meta orchestration

## Toolchain

- **Node 24.x** + **FDK 10.x** per [`docs/engine-matrix.md`](../../../docs/engine-matrix.md) before **`fdk run`** / **`fdk validate`** / **`fdk pack`**.
- Installing or upgrading **Node/FDK**: **fw-setup** skill—not this skill.

## Platform semantics

- **manifest**, **modules**, **requests.json ↔ manifest sync**, **OAuth**, **`renderData`**, **events**, **complexity ≤ 7**, **async/await**, **unused parameters**: **fw-app-dev** is authoritative.
- **fw-new-react-app**: greenfield React Meta (`fdk create`, patterns).
- **fw-react-migrate**: vanilla PF3 → React Meta frontend only.

## Validation

- An app is not "done" until **`fdk validate`**: **0 platform + 0 lint** (same bar as **fw-app-dev**).
